%%dashboard technician-vehicle-evidence-review title: Vehicle Condition Evidence - technician role: technician reports: condition-images-by-phase, condition-images-by-employee, evidence-holds-pending, customer-feedback-by-channel help: The technician reviews pre-service condition evidence and customer concerns before releasing a vehicle.
